WEBVTT

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.760
<i>She was beautiful and strong and kind.</i>

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:49.140
<i>I loved my sister.</i>

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:57.820
I'm going to defeat the Damashigami leader.

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:01.580
Onee-chan, be careful.

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:05.180
<i>And that was it.</i>

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:08.710
<i>My sister never came back.</i>

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:47.060
Ageha the Shinigami

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:48.810
Brace yourselves, your 
midterm results are coming.

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:50.600
Crap!

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:52.240
Bombed it again!

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:53.560
Lucky!

00:02:53.560 --> 00:02:56.690
Health and Physical Education I
 1-4 Momoi Rika

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:56.690
Yay, 100%!

00:02:57.520 --> 00:02:59.230
Good job, Rika-chan.

00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:00.970
It might be thanks to this.

00:03:00.970 --> 00:03:02.150
Your mechanical pencil?

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:04.390
It's supposed to make you smarter.

00:03:04.990 --> 00:03:06.700
I got it for free.

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:11.420
<i>What the...</i>

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:14.120
What is this evil aura?

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:15.170
Jumonji-kun.

00:03:15.630 --> 00:03:18.940
Rika-chan, isn't that the rumored pencil?

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:20.070
What rumor?

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:23.930
I heard a rumor recently about a mechanical 
pencil that makes you smarter.

00:03:24.570 --> 00:03:26.780
They don't sell them at stores.

00:03:26.780 --> 00:03:32.790
You can only get it as a free sample if 
you're lucky enough to meet a salesperson.

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:41.600
But anyone that uses the pencil and 
gets 100% on an exam goes missing.

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:37.670
Math I

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:46.080
No way.

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:48.250
This is bad; you got 100%.

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:50.290
It's fine.

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:52.200
See you, bye.

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:53.540
You're leaving already?

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.080
It's not even noon yet.

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.160
Rika-chan.

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:03.330
<i>She's being pulled by the evil aura.</i>

00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:09.430
<i>Rokudou-kun's gone, just when we need him.</i>

00:04:09.770 --> 00:04:11.680
Mamiya-san, I'll go stop her.

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:13.810
I'll go, too, Tsubasa-kun.

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:16.270
Rika-chan.

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:23.240
What's going on?

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:24.760
Rika's just walking.

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:26.870
And we're running, but we can't keep up.

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:33.750
That pencil...

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.330
It's not just Rika?

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:51.350
<i>A Damashigami's aura.</i>

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:54.850
<i>They're pulling all those 
victims into the Reidou.</i>

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:06.360
<i>I should be able to catch the 
Damashigami where they arrive.</i>

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:11.330
<i>Coins?!</i>

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:17.370
Who are you?!

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:24.380
That's as far as you go.

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:26.550
Surrender, Damashigami!

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:31.130
<i>She's a Shinigami.</i>

00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:34.540
Damashigami? You mean me?

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:37.440
You lured humans into the Reidou. 
That's perfect evidence.

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:39.030
You're under arrest!

00:05:49.760 --> 00:05:52.370
You're not bad for a Damashigami.

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:55.070
I think you're making a mistake.

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:56.440
I don't need your excuses.

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:59.890
Who else would do this?

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:01.990
It's that guy who gave me my pencil.

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:05.230
Hello, everyone.

00:06:05.230 --> 00:06:06.920
You really saved us.

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:09.720
I got 100% thanks to you.

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:12.090
Now, now, right this way.

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:14.220
Wobble...

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:23.170
So you're the Damashigami!

00:06:26.190 --> 00:06:27.150
Stop!

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:35.220
Wobble, wobble!

00:06:37.320 --> 00:06:38.520
Wait, you.

00:06:38.520 --> 00:06:40.540
I don't know who you are, 
but stay out of this.

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:42.050
I'm getting him.

00:06:42.050 --> 00:06:43.930
We have to save the victims first.

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:48.740
There's a rumor that people are 
going missing using the pencil.

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:53.010
That means at least a few people have 
already been taken to the afterlife unjustly.

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:56.210
<i>I see.</i>

00:06:56.710 --> 00:06:59.640
<i>I was so caught up trying 
to catch the Damashigami;</i>

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:02.100
<i>I wasn't thinking about the victims.</i>

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:20.450
Wobble, wobble, wobble!

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:21.170
Mechanical Pencil Studio

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:23.570
His hideout?

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:24.870
No doubt.

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:29.340
Oh, yeah. I heard you can get 
money for smoking out a hideout.

00:07:32.380 --> 00:07:33.760
Mechanical Pencil Studio

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:35.980
Prepare yourselves, Damashigami!

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:37.200
Wobble, wobble...

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:38.890
Wobble, wobble, wobble!

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:46.060
You're not getting away!

00:07:46.470 --> 00:07:48.440
Prepare yourselves, my moolas!

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:05.080
<i>H-He's strong.</i>

00:08:09.680 --> 00:08:11.110
I'm saved.

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:12.340
Thank goodness.

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:18.060
We've been forced to assemble pencils 
ever since they captured us.

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:19.430
I'll send you back to the living world.

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:21.090
Thank you.

00:08:21.090 --> 00:08:22.810
We can finally go home.

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:25.710
<i>He took out a Damashigami 
hideout in an instant.</i>

00:08:26.770 --> 00:08:28.320
<i>Who is he?</i>

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:36.820
Sorry, I got carried away.

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:42.960
Would you settle for 
fifty-fifty on the bounty?

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:45.000
I don't want money.

00:08:47.050 --> 00:08:49.120
I'm Ageha the Shinigami.

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:51.800
I live only to defeat Damashigamis.

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:55.550
I have a good reason for 
going after the Damashigamis.

00:08:58.880 --> 00:08:59.560
That reason—

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:07.740
Aren't you interested in 
what people have to say?!

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:16.570
<i>Oh, yeah. His red hair...</i>

00:09:17.730 --> 00:09:19.790
<i>I've seen it somewhere before.</i>

00:09:24.440 --> 00:09:28.070
I'm so glad you didn't go missing, Rika-chan.

00:09:28.070 --> 00:09:29.130
Yeah.

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:31.180
I don't remember it too well, though...

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:32.250
What about the pencil?

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:34.350
It's creepy, so I threw it out.

00:09:34.350 --> 00:09:35.760
That's the right thing to do.

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:42.490
What's wrong, Sakura-chan?

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:48.840
<i>I just felt like someone looked at me.</i>

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:52.770
Staaare...

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:54.890
What should we do after school today?

00:09:54.890 --> 00:09:56.660
Let's go to the café by the station.

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:57.950
Sounds good.

00:09:58.530 --> 00:10:00.160
Shoot, close one.

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:03.660
Staaaaaaare...

00:10:05.550 --> 00:10:06.790
That scared me.

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:10.420
<i>Staaaaaaaaaaaare...</i>

00:10:10.970 --> 00:10:14.120
I like looking, but being looked at...

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:16.050
I'm so shy!

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:18.300
<i>A camera?</i>

00:10:19.590 --> 00:10:20.800
Really?

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:22.510
Bounty

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:25.390
So then you got all the 
reward money to yourself?

00:10:25.390 --> 00:10:26.380
Yeah.

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:29.630
Good thing she was such a kind lady.

00:10:29.630 --> 00:10:31.570
I don't think I'll see her again.

00:10:31.570 --> 00:10:35.170
Imagine if she came after you saying 
she wanted the money after all.

00:10:35.170 --> 00:10:36.910
No way.

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:48.790
There you are.

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:51.040
Who are you?

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:54.890
I'm the one who captured the 
Damashigami with you earlier.

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:57.050
Ageha, the Shinigami.

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:00.720
You remember me, don't you?

00:11:03.650 --> 00:11:04.260
Sneak...

00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:10.140
Oh, you're the kind lady that 
let us keep all the bounty.

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:14.440
Actually, I've been thinking...

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:18.310
Toss.

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:22.760
Hey!

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:23.950
Why did you kick me out?

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:29.010
I intend to use all the bounty 
money to pay off my debt.

00:11:25.940 --> 00:11:27.200
Come on!

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:29.010
Hey!

00:11:29.010 --> 00:11:31.370
I can't give it back now.

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:30.730
Open up!

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:33.330
What?

00:11:33.740 --> 00:11:35.860
Who ever said anything about money?

00:11:35.860 --> 00:11:37.590
Didn't I tell you you can keep all of it?

00:11:52.840 --> 00:11:54.810
So what did you want from me?

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:59.410
I wanted to ask you something.

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:00.510
Ask what?

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:03.110
About Damashigami Company.

00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:10.330
My family used to be an elite within the 
Shinigami world. We had a good history.

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:14.640
Aside from our regular duties as Shinigami,

00:12:14.640 --> 00:12:19.250
we established a reputation for 
taking down countless Damashigamis:

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:22.630
the foul Shinigamis who take 
people to the afterlife

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:24.970
before their time, 
in order to meet their quota.

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:31.100
But one year ago, my only sister...

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:34.360
I'm going to defeat the Damashigami leader.

00:12:36.640 --> 00:12:38.900
With that, she left, and...

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:41.640
And she never came back.

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:43.110
She's missing?

00:12:43.540 --> 00:12:47.290
Summer, a few months later, I received this.

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:50.700
Ageha-sama

00:12:50.700 --> 00:12:56.460
Summer greetings!
 I have a boyfriend now!!
 He's an older guy, 
but he's so nice!

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:56.460
Rinne-sama, it's...

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:59.960
Ageha-sama

00:12:57.430 --> 00:12:59.510
My dad.

00:13:00.370 --> 00:13:04.200
My proper sister went off 
with some complete stranger.

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:06.680
No, this person is Rinne-sama's fa—

00:13:08.840 --> 00:13:11.100
So what do you want me to do?

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:14.160
She was seduced by some complete stranger.

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:19.490
She abandoned her work, and now I have to 
fight Damashigami Company in her place.

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:20.730
So...

00:13:22.810 --> 00:13:25.020
If you know anything, please, tell me.

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:27.090
Where is the Damashigami 
Company headquarters?

00:13:27.090 --> 00:13:29.230
Or do you know what their leader looks like?

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:35.870
<i>In other words, she doesn't 
know that her sister's boyfriend</i>

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:40.000
<i>is my dad, and that he's the boss 
of the Damashigami Company.</i>

00:13:40.370 --> 00:13:43.580
I don't care if he's the leader or not;

00:13:43.580 --> 00:13:47.030
I'll beat the crap out of 
anyone who's related to him!

00:13:47.030 --> 00:13:48.630
The <i>crap</i>!

00:13:49.860 --> 00:13:53.140
Rinne-sama, did you hear that?

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:55.370
But I need my crap.

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:57.370
Young President!

00:14:00.450 --> 00:14:02.900
I'm here on the president's orders.

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:04.280
Damashigami!

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:12.330
How could you?!

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:15.050
Did he just say "young president"?

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:16.200
You misheard.

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:18.460
Rinne-sama, look.

00:14:21.430 --> 00:14:22.100
Here.

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:27.760
Invoice

00:14:26.180 --> 00:14:27.760
Invoice?

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:33.080
Hey, Rinne, it's Dad.

00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:35.410
I'm charging you for the losses

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:39.960
and emotional damage we suffered 
thanks to the flu you gave us.

00:14:42.620 --> 00:14:46.780
I, too, despise the Damashigami Company.

00:14:47.050 --> 00:14:48.520
Really?

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:51.160
Then can you help me?

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:54.120
I guess, I'll do what I can.

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:56.660
Thank you!

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:58.620
Rokudou-kun.

00:14:58.620 --> 00:15:00.250
Sakura-sama.

00:15:04.450 --> 00:15:05.980
Mamiya Sakura.

00:15:05.980 --> 00:15:06.820
Oh, damn!

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:14.750
S-Sorry to come in unannounced.

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:16.010
Wait, this is...

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:21.390
No!

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:30.070
Why?

00:15:32.050 --> 00:15:34.730
<i>A Shinigami girl?</i>

00:15:36.650 --> 00:15:38.150
Mamiya Sakura.

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:41.040
Just so you don't get the wrong idea...

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:43.950
Yeah, you were holding hands, huh?

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:46.040
That's the wrong idea.

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:50.260
What have I done?

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:55.900
But I'm so happy.

00:15:55.900 --> 00:15:57.990
I have a friend for the first time.

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:02.200
Let's fight together.

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:05.750
He actually looked like a nice person.

00:16:05.960 --> 00:16:10.210
50% upgrade

00:16:06.870 --> 00:16:09.150
<i>Her memory is off.</i>

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:14.890
Oh, jeez!

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:23.540
His red hair...

00:16:23.540 --> 00:16:25.890
I knew I've seen it somewhere.

00:16:25.890 --> 00:16:28.130
It's the same as Onee-chan's boyfriend.

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:31.710
What a coincidence!

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:35.950
So anyway, I met her for 
the first time today.

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:37.510
We aren't even friends.

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:39.010
Yeah.

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:40.700
You understand, right?

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:41.340
Yeah.

00:16:41.340 --> 00:16:42.390
That aside...

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:43.730
That aside?!

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:46.110
There's something I wanted 
to talk to you about.

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:54.950
Stop! What do you think you're doing?!

00:16:54.950 --> 00:16:56.990
I was just watching!

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:01.110
Let go!

00:17:01.110 --> 00:17:03.770
It's spy gear from the afterlife.

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:05.550
Don't look! Stop looking at me!

00:17:03.770 --> 00:17:05.870
It's uploading video somewhere.

00:17:05.550 --> 00:17:06.400
I'm shy!

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:07.700
Spy?

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:08.770
Me?

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:10.990
Sakura-sama, do you have any 
idea what this is about?

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:11.880
No.

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:16.230
But it was kind of following 
me around all day.

00:17:16.230 --> 00:17:18.760
Most people don't seem to be able to see it.

00:17:20.750 --> 00:17:22.640
Kaboom!

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:23.890
Ow!

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:24.560
It exploded.

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:25.560
What's going on?

00:17:28.390 --> 00:17:32.940
Someone from the afterlife 
is spying on Sakura-sama.

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:35.350
Who?

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:36.400
What for?

00:17:36.720 --> 00:17:38.410
Don't worry, Mamiya Sakura.

00:17:42.010 --> 00:17:45.440
I'll capture the vile peep.

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:47.170
Yeah, thanks.

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:53.460
Rokudou-kun, you hold hands 
with anyone, don't you?

00:17:55.490 --> 00:17:57.510
<i>We're back to that again?!</i>

00:18:04.270 --> 00:18:08.680
Man, they caught the spy cam.

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:11.890
I shouldn't have cheaped out on it.

00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:13.290
But, President...

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:14.110
Hm?

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:18.360
Why are you watching a human girl?

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:20.240
I told you, didn't I?

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:23.530
The reason Rinne's so attached 
to the human world is

00:18:23.530 --> 00:18:26.870
because he has a crush on a human girl.

00:18:27.270 --> 00:18:28.040
Yes.

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:31.880
I have to do something about this.

00:18:47.570 --> 00:18:50.060
<i>Her memory is slightly off.</i>

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:55.210
<i>I guess they get along better 
because they're both Shinigamis.</i>

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:57.190
<i>I met her for the first time today.</i>

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:58.650
<i>We aren't even friends.</i>

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:01.990
<i>Then...</i>

00:19:04.360 --> 00:19:07.570
<i>Why was he holding her hands so firmly?</i>

00:19:07.570 --> 00:19:10.420
<i>Her memory is </i>really<i> off.</i>

00:19:12.680 --> 00:19:18.140
<i>Why does it bother me 
so much about those two?</i>

00:19:32.820 --> 00:19:33.880
What's wrong?

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:38.440
Onee-chan, you can see me?

00:19:43.430 --> 00:19:45.450
Can I come with you?

00:19:47.780 --> 00:19:50.390
<i>Shoot, she's a ghost.</i>

00:19:50.390 --> 00:19:52.900
Oh, you can see us?

00:19:53.770 --> 00:19:55.440
Look at me, too.

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:57.530
Me, too.

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:01.550
<i>There's at least thirty 
times more than usual.</i>

00:20:02.610 --> 00:20:03.510
<i>This place...</i>

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:07.310
Twisssst...

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:12.810
Rinne-sama,

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:15.910
What's wrong? You're so out of it.

00:20:16.370 --> 00:20:17.090
Nothing.

00:20:17.090 --> 00:20:20.870
Are you worrying about what happened earlier?

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:31.580
Staaare...

00:20:33.570 --> 00:20:35.170
Staaaaare...

00:20:35.170 --> 00:20:37.520
Staaaaaaare...

00:20:37.520 --> 00:20:39.250
Staaaaaaaaaaaare...

00:20:41.230 --> 00:20:43.340
Staaaaaaaaaaaaaaare....

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:45.090
Staaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaare...

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:49.220
Mamiya... Sakura.

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:55.650
<i>His memory is </i>completely<i> off.</i>

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:58.430
That was bad.

00:20:58.430 --> 00:21:00.600
Sakura-sama saw you.

00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:02.150
That's so not what happened!

00:21:03.200 --> 00:21:04.970
I explained, though.

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:09.160
I wonder if she understood.

00:21:09.630 --> 00:21:11.960
I'm sure it's fine.

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:15.450
I'm more worried about that camera.

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:16.490
Yeah.

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:20.550
Are you sure you shouldn't 
have walked Sakura-sama home?

00:21:23.450 --> 00:21:27.840
First, I want to find out who 
was spying on Mamiya Sakura.

00:21:28.170 --> 00:21:29.030
Right.

00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:31.850
Huh?

00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:34.850
This...

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:40.860
It's connected to the Reidou.

00:21:41.100 --> 00:21:44.610
Sakura-sama might have gone into the Reidou.

00:21:47.800 --> 00:21:49.190
<i>Mamiya Sakura.</i>

00:21:49.190 --> 00:21:51.070
<i>I knew I should have walked you home.</i>

00:21:57.050 --> 00:22:00.500
<i>I ran off in a hurry earlier, but...</i>

00:22:03.080 --> 00:22:07.720
Hi. I was wondering if you 
could tell me some more.

00:22:08.760 --> 00:22:10.510
Hello?

00:22:19.340 --> 00:22:20.020
<i>Huh?</i>

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:26.650
<i>Why is there a Reidou gate here?</i>

00:24:00.080 --> 00:24:25.020
Next Episode:
 Naggy

00:24:00.640 --> 00:24:03.880
I don't mean to nag, but I'm not 
even friends with Ageha yet.

00:24:03.880 --> 00:24:06.090
Do you know what "naggy" means, Rinne-sama?

00:24:06.090 --> 00:24:06.600
Huh?

00:24:06.600 --> 00:24:10.890
To pester people by saying the same things 
over and over, or to go on forever.

00:24:10.890 --> 00:24:11.800
Annoying.

00:24:12.010 --> 00:24:16.350
To pester people by saying the same things 
over and over, or to go on forever.

00:24:16.350 --> 00:24:16.890
Annoying.

00:24:16.890 --> 00:24:17.560
I got it!

00:24:17.560 --> 00:24:19.910
That's what it means to be naggy!

00:24:19.910 --> 00:24:22.010
Remember that Rinne-sama!

00:24:22.520 --> 00:24:25.020
Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>: "Naggy."
